      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 421,
        "name": "嘟嘟莲",
        "desc": "生长在水边的花。花瓣经过烹制口感爽脆，清甜微苦。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Calla Lily_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 464,
        "name": "塞西莉亚花",
        "desc": "名字与外形同等美丽的花朵，只生长在清冷而风急的高处，如同浪子一样真心难以触碰。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cecilia_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 642,
        "name": "小灯草",
        "desc": "在夜间会隐隐散发辉光的野花。与其他食材一同烹饪能提升鲜味。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Small Lamp Grass_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 735,
        "name": "慕风蘑菇",
        "desc": "沐浴着和煦的风而生长的菌类，与风一样生生不息，滋养生命。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Philanemo Mushroom_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1676,
        "name": "钩钩果",
        "desc": "带着勾刺的莓果，会挂在狼的毛皮上来迁徙。看见它时，仿佛能听见狼的凄嚎在林间回荡…",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Wolfhook_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1750,
        "name": "风车菊",
        "desc": "喜好风的植物。对于崇信风、本身也如风一般爽朗自在的蒙德人而言，风车菊便是「看得见的风」。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Windwheel Aster_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1525,
        "name": "落落莓",
        "desc": "饱满透亮的莓果，在口中绽放出清甜的花香。在过去，守望风暴的人仅有的慰藉便是落落莓的甜蜜与对城市安宁的希望。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Valberry_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 891,
        "name": "星螺",
        "desc": "随着海潮来到沙滩上的螺。将耳朵凑近空壳，能听见海充满思念的呼唤。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Starconch_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1349,
        "name": "绝云椒椒",
        "desc": "璃月地方特产的辛辣植物。只要闻到它的味道，身体就会变得炽热，渴求水分。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Jueyun Chili_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1184,
        "name": "琉璃袋",
        "desc": "拥有旺盛生命力的小花，传说朝下盛开的花姿是为了守住它的香气。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Violetgrass_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 471,
        "name": "夜泊石",
        "desc": "稀有的特质矿石，在静谧的暗夜里会幽幽地发光。据称是天地间奔流的元素在异变中凝聚成的珍奇宝石。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Noctilucous Jade_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1730,
        "name": "霓裳花",
        "desc": "在璃月如霓云般盛放的妖红之花，能制成如水般顺滑的织物。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Silk Flower_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1183,
        "name": "琉璃百合",
        "desc": "极为古老的花卉。据说曾经遍布璃月大地，能将大地的记忆积攒成花期时的芬芳。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Glaze Lily_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1048,
        "name": "清心",
        "desc": "只生长在孤高石峰的通透白花。不愿接受平原的温暖与湿润，宁可在清冷的尖峰眺望远方。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Qingxin_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1242,
        "name": "石珀",
        "desc": "极纯的岩元素凝成的珍稀晶石，常与其他矿物伴生。也被称为「岩之心」。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cor Lapis_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1031,
        "name": "海灵芝",
        "desc": "在某些特殊的海域中、岛屿上才会生长的特殊物种。虽然外形看起来像菌类，但其实是由软体生物分泌增生而成的。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sea Ganoderma_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1908,
        "name": "鸣草",
        "desc": "即使在无风的日子里，亦会随雷鸣之声隐隐振动的植物。看起来像是花瓣的结构其实是叶片的延伸，保护着脆弱的花朵。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Naku Weed_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1883,
        "name": "鬼兜虫",
        "desc": "栖息在雷元素富集区域的奇异甲虫。与甲壳上宛如怒目而视的恶鬼之相相反，鬼兜虫其实非常温顺迟钝。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Onikabuto_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 898,
        "name": "晶化骨髓",
        "desc": "蕴含着「祟神」力量的晶体。冶炼时加入这种物质的话，能极大地提高钢铁制品的强度与韧性。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Crystal Marrow_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1574,
        "name": "血斛",
        "desc": "在诗文中也被称为「赤蕊」的鲜艳植物，一度在稻妻列岛绝迹，如今在战场上再度重现。传说在血腥的战场上，它们开得格外妖艳。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Dendrobium_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1362,
        "name": "绯樱绣球",
        "desc": "从鸣神大社的神樱上飘落的花瓣，怀着稻妻大地的眷顾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sakura Bloom_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1178,
        "name": "珊瑚真珠",
        "desc": "与海祇的珊瑚相伴而生的宝珠，散发着月光般的丝丝凉意。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sango Pearl_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 476,
        "name": "天云草实",
        "desc": "生长在清籁岛的天云草结成的果实，贴在耳畔能听见微弱的电流声。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Amakumo Fruit_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 697,
        "name": "幽灯蕈",
        "desc": "如同夜灯般微微发光的蘑菇，其中蕴含着不可思议的力量。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Fluorescent Fungus_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4008,
        "name": "海露花",
        "desc": "<p><span>幽淡而高贵的蓝色花卉。柔软的花蕊具备良好的吸水性和弹性，是诸多日用品的原材料。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/18/88072335/d6429603c5f355d6722a5530c558e499_8763519200832133812.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4009,
        "name": "柔灯铃",
        "desc": "<p><span>静雅而清美的紫色花卉。其香清淡悠长、细腻柔和，因此常被用来制作名贵的香水。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/18/88072335/8c0e01560c70f5fc56e6719ae809d415_3174462674425518385.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4007,
        "name": "虹彩蔷薇",
        "desc": "<p><span>纤婉而柔洁的粉色花卉。虽然被称作蔷薇，但本质上更接近百合。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/18/88072335/670b8958c90014a1bdacba5123c2c9da_1658979066409504343.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4010,
        "name": "苍晶螺",
        "desc": "<p>散发着幽光的贝状结构。似乎是纯净的元素能量凝结而成的产物，而非某种生物的甲壳。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/18/88072335/c528fed9f65720b1d212e9b5e679ca9d_4429142693428760305.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4342,
        "name": "幽光星星",
        "desc": "<p>在水中会发出柔浅微光的软体动物。大多攀附在水边或水下的人造建筑表面。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/27/88072335/98c8fc26791c68b16b468bf458af838e_5181385171938964033.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4341,
        "name": "子探测单元",
        "desc": "<p><span>枫丹科学院利用新型奇械构件生产的微型探测单元，原本用以监测各类环境数据。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/18/88072335/3825519df83eccc4e1e6030fa80fe3cc_5012912097943483764.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4574,
        "name": "湖光铃兰",
        "desc": "<p><span>明澈而澄净的苍色花卉。生于水脉汇聚之处，其香清冷淡雅，辛凉柔婉。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/11/10/327628065/c43e2d148b98d58c98a008b13e37b5b5_3444351177978722120.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4575,
        "name": "初露之源",
        "desc": "<p>悬浮于莫尔泰区水体深处的清澈露滴，与常见的纯水造物不同，似乎凝聚着更为原始而纯粹的元素能量。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2023/12/07/157749474/372a170798a29e732877287ae17db04e_3316936610724768889.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4952,
        "name": "清水玉",
        "desc": "出产于沉玉谷的玉石。触感凉如清水，因此而得名。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/02/01/327628065/637fe2a7402e611f03d7bae55de9606c_1033312458543882068.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6670,
        "name": "灼灼彩菊",
        "desc": "形如飘然羽翼的花，花瓣的姿态在风中无比悠然。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/23/ea53e316068a301cafa20df91347a484_2697579050493460776.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6671,
        "name": "青蜜莓",
        "desc": "青蓝色的，汁液丰富的莓果。其果树大片生长在「悬木人」部族附近，是形态与火榴果相近的植物。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/23/ffa28222b172e739e1f3abf09598fc00_2776396698678739070.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6669,
        "name": "浪沫羽鳃",
        "desc": "生长在海边如羽状的特殊物种，看似是水草般的植物，实际上是形态特殊的水栖软体珊瑚。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/27/06f57f7b0ca5715a8927831e4177f36d_85669012353655417.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6672,
        "name": "肉龙掌",
        "desc": "<p>形如巨大动物爪掌的多肉植物。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/17/59155606/43d706b47498c550dfac757c35714368_4007146100210566240.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7163,
        "name": "枯叶紫英",
        "desc": "叶片与花瓣呈现枯焦之态的花朵，常常能在流灰弥漫之处看到它。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/11/14/8e8b48c2f8b649faa03655081c5ca332_7042901679055518409.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7162,
        "name": "微光角菌",
        "desc": "在黑暗中微微发出光芒的菌类，因为形似暝视龙的角冠而被称为角菌。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/11/14/77a9638bc0cb33a3de62209934f0d3db_1155012823071897200.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7526,
        "name": "云岩裂叶",
        "desc": "花叶的外侧犹如石质的奇特植物，在绽放后，会露出晶石一般的芯。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/82902cec095daf4d3a0aad3d0e975075_2256101611360374803.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7527,
        "name": "琉鳞石",
        "desc": "沉积在富含燃素的区域，逐渐形成的红色鳞状晶石，蕴含极高的热量。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/03/17/987f2402b2589552ea4a27111e7eb968_7580151143908062396.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8620,
        "name": "便携轴承",
        "desc": "愚人众进驻挪德卡莱后大量制造的便携轴承单元。损耗过度的单元也会像失去用途的单位一样被抛弃。<br>其中偶尔还会残存一些微弱的月矩力。由于难以仿造，有时也会被那夏镇的商人当作等价交换的凭物。<br>也正是因为如此，据说曾经有人试图伪造过这些单元。最终似乎是因为伪造的成本高于它们作为一般等价物的价格而破产了。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/01/f1f7b92e9cffc5624b3fbdd25b36a4f3_499475582312170606.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8621,
        "name": "霜盏花",
        "desc": "形如烛盏的花卉，多生长在水边，香气寒冽素净，有安神的功效。<br>花蕊与花茎彼此相异的色彩被认为是两种不同的月矩力的象征，然而霜盏花却是极为罕有的、不会受到月矩力任何影响的植物，因此有时也会被霜月之子的追随者们视为无信者与叛离者的象征。<br>据说五百年前的漆黑灾厄结束时，这种造型奇异的花朵才出现在大地上，但这种说法从未得到过严谨的考证。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/01/e33339f0209623f7608a3d414593a95c_3596443329389083818.png",
